{"events":[{"id":12819,"global_id":"llibreriabyron.com?id=12819","global_id_lineage":["llibreriabyron.com?id=12819"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-07-15 15:19:33","date_utc":"2026-07-15 15:19:33","modified":"2026-07-30 11:16:32","modified_utc":"2026-07-30 11:16:32","url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/activitat\/joanna-darc-byron-experience\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/12819","title":"Joanna D&#8217;arc &#8211; Byron Experience","description":"<p>Dissabte 29 d\u2019agost, a les 20 h.<br \/>\nJOANNA D\u2019ARC \u2014 Byron Experience<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\u00abJoanna d&#8217;Arc arriba a Llibreria Byron amb un concert per a fam\u00edlies on la veu i el violoncel creen un univers sonor inspirat en la naturalesa i l&#8217;experi\u00e8ncia humana. Una proposta original que uneix folk, imaginaci\u00f3 i emoci\u00f3\u00bb.<\/b><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Joanna d&#8217;Arc<\/b> presenta un concert en el qual la veu i el violoncel s&#8217;uneixen per a crear paisatges sonors evocadors i intensament emocionals. El seu repertori, compost principalment per can\u00e7ons originals, transita entre el folk, la m\u00fasica c\u00e8ltica, elements neocl\u00e0ssics i l&#8217;\u00e8pica cinematogr\u00e0fica, donant forma a un llenguatge art\u00edstic propi i distintiu.<\/p>\n<p>Inspirades en la naturalesa, les llegendes, la mem\u00f2ria i l&#8217;experi\u00e8ncia humana, les seves composicions conviden al p\u00fablic a detenir-se, escoltar i connectar amb all\u00f2 que ens fa profundament humans.<\/p>\n<p><b>Joanna d&#8217;Arc<\/b> desenvolupa una proposta on interpretaci\u00f3, composici\u00f3 i producci\u00f3 pr\u00f2pia convergeixen en una experi\u00e8ncia immersiva, \u00edntima i emotiva. M\u00e9s que un concert, \u00e9s una invitaci\u00f3 a compartir un espai d&#8217;escolta i connexi\u00f3 a trav\u00e9s de la calidesa de la veu i el so org\u00e0nic del violoncel.<\/p>\n<p>Un viatge sonor que us transporta a un altre m\u00f3n, on la uni\u00f3 de veu i violoncel us transforma.<\/p>\n<p><b>PREU: <\/b>De 16 a 25 \u20ac<br \/>\n<b>VENDA D\u2019ENTRADES: <\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/entradium.com\/es\/events\/joanna-d-arc-voz-y-chelo\">https:\/\/entradium.com\/es\/events\/joanna-d-arc-voz-y-chelo<\/a><\/p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter  wp-image-12924\" src=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"547\" height=\"684\" srcset=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-200x250.jpeg 200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-400x500.jpeg 400w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-600x751.jpeg 600w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-768x961.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-800x1001.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-819x1024.jpeg 819w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-1200x1501.jpeg 1200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc-1228x1536.jpeg 1228w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Joanna-darc.jpeg 1279w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 547px) 100vw, 547px\" \/><\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"joanna-darc-byron-experience","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-08-29 20:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"08","day":"29","hour":"20","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-08-29 21:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"08","day":"29","hour":"21","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_start_date":"2026-08-29 20:00:00","utc_start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"08","day":"29","hour":"20","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_end_date":"2026-08-29 21:00:00","utc_end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"08","day":"29","hour":"21","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"timezone":"UTC+0","timezone_abbr":"UTC+0","cost":"","cost_details":{"currency_symbol":"","currency_position":"","values":[]},"website":"","show_map":true,"show_map_link":true,"hide_from_listings":false,"sticky":false,"featured":false,"categories":[],"tags":[],"venue":[],"organizer":[],"ticketed":false},{"id":12828,"global_id":"llibreriabyron.com?id=12828","global_id_lineage":["llibreriabyron.com?id=12828"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-07-17 10:07:58","date_utc":"2026-07-17 10:07:58","modified":"2026-07-30 11:17:06","modified_utc":"2026-07-30 11:17:06","url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/activitat\/yurii-kartuzov-byron-piano\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/12828","title":"Yurii Kartuzov &#8211; Byron Piano","description":"<p>Dimecres 2 de setembre, a les 20h.<br \/>\nYURII KARTUZOV \u2014 Byron Piano<\/p>\n<p>Amb la col\u00b7laboraci\u00f3 d\u2019@onafutura<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>\u00abYurii Kartuzov torna a Llibreria Byron amb <\/b><b><i>\u201cAppassionata\u201d<\/i><\/b><b> de Beethoven i Quatre Ballades de Chopin\u00bb.\u00a0<\/b><\/p>\n<p><b>Yurii Kartuzov<\/b> \u00e9s un pianista guanyador de concursos internacionals com ara HDGPP (Cro\u00e0cia, 2023), Humberto Quagliata (Italy, 2025), Citt\u00e1 di Pesaro (Italy, 2026).<br \/>\n<b><\/b><b>Beethoven<\/b> mateix considerava la <i>Sonata per a piano n\u00fam. 23 en fa menor, Op. 57 \u201cAppassionata\u201d<\/i> una de les millors obres que mai havia creat. Aquesta Sonata continua sent una prova per a l\u2019int\u00e8rpret i una revelaci\u00f3 per a l\u2019oient \u2014 una obra en qu\u00e8<b> Beethoven<\/b> assoleix un equilibri poc habitual entre passi\u00f3 elemental i rigor arquitect\u00f2nic.<br \/>\nLes Quatre Balades de<b> Chopin<\/b> rarament s&#8217;interpreten \u00edntegrament en un mateix recital. Aquesta \u00e9s una ocasi\u00f3 \u00fanica per endinsar-se en l&#8217;univers m\u00e9s \u00edntim i apassionat del compositor, seguint un recorregut fascinant que va des de la delicadesa m\u00e9s l\u00edrica fins a l&#8217;\u00e8pica i la for\u00e7a m\u00e9s colpidora.<\/p>\n<p><b>Programa:<br \/>\n<\/b><b>Ludwig Van Beethoven:<br \/>\n<\/b>Sonata n\u00ba23 en Fa menor, Op. 57 &#8220;Appassionata&#8221; (28&#8242;)<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Allegro assai<\/li>\n<li>Andante con moto &#8211; attacca<\/li>\n<li>Allegro, ma non troppo &#8211; Presto<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><b>Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Chopin:<br \/>\n<\/b>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Balada n\u00ba1 en Sol menor, Op. 23 (13&#8242;)<br \/>\nBalada n\u00ba2 en Fa major, Op. 38 ( 8&#8242;)<br \/>\nBalada n\u00ba3 en La bemol major, Op. 47 (10&#8242;)<br \/>\nBalada n\u00ba4 en Fa menor, Op. 52 (15&#8242;)<\/p>\n<p><b>PREUS: <\/b>De 16 a 25 \u20ac<br \/>\n<b>VENDA D\u2019ENTRADES: <\/b><a href=\"https:\/\/entradium.com\/es\/events\/yurii-kartuzov-betthoven-y-chopin\">https:\/\/entradium.com\/es\/events\/yurii-kartuzov-betthoven-y-chopin<\/a><\/p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter  wp-image-12923\" src=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"571\" height=\"714\" srcset=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-200x250.jpeg 200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-400x500.jpeg 400w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-600x750.jpeg 600w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-768x960.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-800x1000.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-819x1024.jpeg 819w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov-1200x1500.jpeg 1200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/Yurii-Kartuzov.jpeg 1215w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 571px) 100vw, 571px\" \/><\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"yurii-kartuzov-byron-piano","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-09-02 20:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"09","day":"02","hour":"20","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-09-02 21:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"09","day":"02","hour":"21","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_start_date":"2026-09-02 20:00:00","utc_start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"09","day":"02","hour":"20","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"utc_end_date":"2026-09-02 21:00:00","utc_end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"09","day":"02","hour":"21","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"timezone":"UTC+0","timezone_abbr":"UTC+0","cost":"","cost_details":{"currency_symbol":"","currency_position":"","values":[]},"website":"","show_map":true,"show_map_link":true,"hide_from_listings":false,"sticky":false,"featured":false,"categories":[],"tags":[],"venue":[],"organizer":[],"ticketed":false},{"id":12916,"global_id":"llibreriabyron.com?id=12916","global_id_lineage":["llibreriabyron.com?id=12916"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-07-30 10:36:58","date_utc":"2026-07-30 10:36:58","modified":"2026-07-30 11:13:23","modified_utc":"2026-07-30 11:13:23","url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/activitat\/destellos-de-la-nada-de-alba-irene-gonzalez-2\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/12916","title":"&#8220;Destellos de la nada&#8221;, de Alba Irene Gonz\u00e1lez","description":"<p>Viernes 4 de septiembre, 18:45h<br \/>\n<em>&#8220;Destellos de la nada&#8221;, <\/em>de Alba Irene Gonz\u00e1lez &#8211; Presentaci\u00f3n de libro<\/p>\n<p>Os invitamos a la presentaci\u00f3n del libro <em>&#8220;Destellos de la nada&#8221;, <\/em>escrito por <strong>Alba Irene Gonz\u00e1lez<\/strong> y presentado por <strong>Jes\u00fas Aguado.<br \/>\n<\/strong>Durante la presentaci\u00f3n, la autora recitar\u00e1 una selecci\u00f3n de poemas, acompa\u00f1\u00e1ndose al piano, en un di\u00e1logo entre m\u00fasica y poes\u00eda.<strong><br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Sinopsis:<\/strong><br \/>\nDestellos de la nada invita al lector a interrogarse sobre la existencia y su fragilidad. A trav\u00e9s de poemas que exploran la muerte, la p\u00e9rdida y el fracaso, la voz po\u00e9tica descubre en el amor y en la poes\u00eda un refugio desde el que resistir y dar sentido a la experiencia.<\/p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter  wp-image-12918\" src=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"603\" height=\"754\" srcset=\"https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-200x250.jpeg 200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-240x300.jpeg 240w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-400x500.jpeg 400w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-600x750.jpeg 600w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-768x960.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-800x1000.jpeg 800w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-819x1024.jpeg 819w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre-1200x1500.jpeg 1200w, https:\/\/llibreriabyron.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/destellos-de-la-nada-presentacio-llibre.jpeg 1215w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 603px) 100vw, 603px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"destellos-de-la-nada-de-alba-irene-gonzalez-2","ima